## Data Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer / VS Code
    participant Agent as Agent @ Koyeb
    participant LLM as vLLM @ Koyeb
    participant MCP as MCP Gateway On-Prem
    participant Sys as Internal Systems

    Dev->>Agent: Coding task
    Agent->>LLM: Plan request
    LLM-->>Agent: Plan / tool request

    Agent->>MCP: MCP tool request
    MCP->>MCP: Auth + RBAC + policy check
    MCP->>Sys: Run allowed action
    Sys-->>MCP: Result
    MCP->>MCP: Filter / redact result
    MCP-->>Agent: Tool result

    Agent->>LLM: Updated context
    LLM-->>Agent: Next action / final output
    Agent-->>Dev: Result
```

