## Main Advantages

- Less agent infrastructure on-prem
- Easier central scaling
- Agent and LLM are close together
- Easier multi-agent deployment
- Cloud workers can be scaled independently

## Main Risks

- Agent state is outside the company network
- More code and context may leave the company network
- Cloud Agent needs controlled access back to on-prem systems
- MCP Gateway becomes security-critical
- More provider dependency than Option A
